  "description": "One Tree Close\r(G6) Mixed Species group: Whitebeam, Hawthorn, Plum, Hazel, Dogwood\rReduce overhang back to edge of pavement.\rDBH 75-150mm\rHeight 2-6m\rCrown spread 0.5-3m\rDensely planted on embankment.\rOverhang at eastern end of group obscuring light throw over steps.\r\r(G15) Mixed Species Group: Ash, Plum Elder\rEstablish ownership and remove to ground level where possible, otherwise selectively prune\rcrowns to provide clearance from garage building.\rDBH 75mm\rHeight 6.0m\rCrown spread 3.0m\rOvergrown self-set specimens along rear of garage block.\rBlocking maintenance access alley.\rCrowns in contact with roof.\r\r(T16) Sycamore\rClear Access to and around the base of the tree, sever Ivy and remove from tree.\rDBH 400mm\rHeight 16.0m\rCrown spread 5.0m\rTree is inaccessible due to dense understory.\rIvy covered stem to 6 m.\r\rPlease note that we did not perform the large rip cut on T18 - this is unauthorised pruning\rpotentially, instructed by neighbours to rear. There is also a rip cut on small plum sapling on\rG6, potentially done by gardeners or residents.",
